## Brand and asset notice

The MIT licence covers the source code in this repository.

It does **not** grant rights to the CNPS name, logo, or other trademarks. The
CNPS name and any marks issued by CNPS remain the property of CNPS — Caisse
Nationale de la Prévoyance Sociale — and may only be used to identify the
official application.

The artwork at `assets/branding/CNPS_standup_logo.png`, and every icon derived
from it by `scripts/icons/generate_icons.py`, is original project artwork. It is
**not** an official CNPS logo and is not covered by any CNPS trademark claim. It
carries the project name only. Replace it with official CNPS brand assets, and
re-run `scripts/icons/generate_icons.py`, before distributing this application
under the CNPS name.